  "answer_text": "Good news \u2014 **Miraculous Ladybug Season 2, Episode 12 has already aired!** It is not an upcoming episode. Here are the details depending on which episode ordering you're referring to:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udc1e Season 2, Episode 12 \u2014 **\"Gorizilla\"**\nSeason 2, Episode 12 (\"Gorizilla\") aired on **May 13, 2018**. In this episode, Adrien's bodyguard gets akumatized into Gorizilla, who, endowed with extraordinary strength and an acute sense of smell, tracks Adrien all through Paris.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udc1e Alternate Episode 12 \u2014 **\"Sapotis\"**\nThe official Miraculous Ladybug website lists a different episode as Season 2, Episode 12 depending on the episode order used:\n\nIn **\"Sapotis\"**, while Marinette and Alya are having a sleepover, Alya's little sisters Etta and Ella get akumatized by Hawk Moth into Sapotis \u2014 small, out-of-control monsters who multiply upon eating and wreak havoc across the city. Overwhelmed and outnumbered, Ladybug calls on a new superhero, choosing Alya and entrusting her with the Fox Miraculous. Alya transforms into **Rena Rouge**, the fox superheroine armed with an illusion flute!\n\n---\n\nSince the episode numbering can vary by region and platform, both of these episodes have long since aired. The entire Season 2 is currently available to watch! You can find it on platforms like **Netflix** or **Disney+**.",
